1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
How to install PocketRoles (3 minutes)
1. Extract both zip files you received into the same folder

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,500
2. Open "PocketRoles Launcher.cmd" and this window appears
(if Windows warns: More info -> Run anyway)

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:14,000
3. Press "Install"

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
It copies your Steam game and installs BepInEx + PocketRoles
(the first time can take a few minutes)

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
"Install complete" means you are done

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
4. Start Steam, then press "Launch"

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Only the first launch takes 1-2 minutes (just wait)

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:30,000
When the log says "Launched", look at the game:
PocketRoles in the right window of the menu = success

9
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:36,500
That's it. Other players install nothing.
Questions: pocketroles.report+help@gmail.com (we reply)
